2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Mod\055\044\134phi\040\044\040convergence\072\040Approximation\040of\040discrete\040measures\040and\040harmonic\040analysis\040on\040the\040torus)
/Author (Reda\040Chhaibi\054\040Freddy\040Delbaen\054\040Pierre\055Loïc\040Méliot\054\040Ashkan\040Nikeghbali)
/Subject (In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040relate\040the\040framework\040of\040mod\055\044\134phi\044\040convergence\040to\040the\040construction\040of\040approximation\040schemes\040for\040lattice\055distributed\040random\040variables\056\040The\040point\040of\040view\040taken\040here\040is\040that\040of\040Fourier\040analysis\040in\040the\040Wiener\040algebra\054\040allowing\040the\040computation\040of\040asymptotic\040equivalents\040in\040the\040local\054\040Kolmogorov\040and\040total\040variation\040distances\056\040By\040using\040signed\040measures\040instead\040of\040probability\040measures\054\040we\040are\040able\040to\040construct\040better\040approximations\040of\040discrete\040lattice\040distributions\040than\040the\040standard\040Poisson\040approximation\056\040This\040theory\040applies\040to\040various\040examples\040arising\040from\040combinatorics\040and\040number\040theory\072\040number\040of\040cycles\040in\040\050possibly\040coloured\051\040permutations\054\040number\040of\040prime\040divisors\040\050possibly\040within\040different\040residue\040classes\051\040of\040a\040random\040integer\054\040number\040of\040irreducible\040factors\040of\040a\040random\040polynomial\054\040etc\056\040One\040advantage\040of\040the\040approach\040developed\040in\040this\040paper\040is\040that\040it\040allows\040us\040to\040deal\040with\040approximations\040in\040higher\040dimensions\040as\040well\056\040In\040this\040setting\054\040we\040can\040explicitly\040see\040the\040influence\040of\040the\040correlations\040between\040the\040components\040of\040the\040random\040vectors\040in\040our\040asymptotic\040formulas\056)
/Keywords (26\040Jun\0402020\054\040Annales\040de\040l\047Institut\040Fourier\054\040Random\040variable\054\040Number\040theory\054\040Wiener\040algebra\054\040Probability\040measure\054\040Poisson\040distribution\054\040Institut\040de\040Mathématiques\040de\040Toulouse\054\040Département\040de\040Mathématiques\054\040University\040of\040Zurich)
>>
endobj
